  {
    "id": "401949",
    "original": "加齢臭は、年を重ねると出てくる中高年独特のにおいのことだ。世間で言う「おっさん臭い」や「おやじ臭」というのは、この加齢臭のことだ。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "401953",
        "text": "Kareishu is a special smell that comes as old people age. Popular expressions such as: \"Ossan kusai\" or \"Oyaji kusai\" (smelly old man) refer to this smell."
